{"3897090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Temple Maker 64", "steam_appid": 3897090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple Maker 64 is a third-person dungeon creator. Build dungeons full of traps and puzzles, or grab your sword and explore community-made dungeons. Choose from a vast selection of items, monsters, puzzle elements, and bosses, all wrapped up in an N64-inspired love letter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN TEMPLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your rooms, build different floors, and choose from a wide selection of objects ranging from <strong>traps and monsters</strong> to <strong>puzzle elements</strong>. Imagine challenges involving classic items such as <strong>bows</strong>, <strong>bombs</strong>, and <strong>grapples</strong>, as well as unique items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3D editor for creating Temples is <strong>intuitive</strong>, <strong>easy-to-use</strong>, and requires no prior experience whatsoever. Shape your rooms, place elements, connect them together, simple as that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE OTHER TEMPLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/6db702076627c2a6df5f4110016d78db.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/6db702076627c2a6df5f4110016d78db.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/6db702076627c2a6df5f4110016d78db.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building's not your thing? You can also explore the many community-made Temples! Use the <strong>items</strong> at your disposal to overcome <strong>challenges</strong>, solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, and fend off <strong>monsters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/ff81dd332fad6381187104e6c86946a1.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/ff81dd332fad6381187104e6c86946a1.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/ff81dd332fad6381187104e6c86946a1.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple Maker 64's gameplay has been carefully designed to be familiar. <strong>Experience and skill</strong> in retro 3D action-adventure games will be <strong>transferable</strong> to this game seamlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/af47a76b264046f9878b96e039e914f3.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/af47a76b264046f9878b96e039e914f3.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/af47a76b264046f9878b96e039e914f3.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dceb2f77e81d5a83ac5137c5e4113fc5.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dceb2f77e81d5a83ac5137c5e4113fc5.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dceb2f77e81d5a83ac5137c5e4113fc5.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple Maker 64 aims to <strong>revive mechanics</strong> from classic retro action-adventure games. Some items will definitely feel familiar, but you should also expect a few <strong>surprises</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple Maker 64 is a third-person dungeon creator. Build dungeons full of traps and puzzles, or grab your sword and explore community-made dungeons. Choose from a vast selection of items, monsters, puzzle elements, and bosses, all wrapped up in an N64-inspired love letter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN TEMPLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/d32015d7bcdbd0c94073f63a58f75154.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your rooms, build different floors, and choose from a wide selection of objects ranging from <strong>traps and monsters</strong> to <strong>puzzle elements</strong>. Imagine challenges involving classic items such as <strong>bows</strong>, <strong>bombs</strong>, and <strong>grapples</strong>, as well as unique items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/45b903a019382d652eac6165344df97e.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.webm?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/dd813e36da9c9e7c4fca7948ad7197c1.mp4?t=1783602189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3D editor for creating Temples is <strong>intuitive</strong>, <strong>easy-to-use</strong>, and requires no prior experience whatsoever. Shape your rooms, place elements, connect them together, simple as that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE OTHER TEMPLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897090/extras/6db702076627c2a6df5f4110016d78db.poster.avif?t=1783602189\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset